{
"file": 15,
"paths": [
"d002/f609"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "708480bc",
"en_raw": "'Carries your feelings,' my foot"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "adea1079",
"en_raw": "That little-girl hobby"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "b6d43046",
"en_raw": "where did that even come from?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "3d56ae87",
"en_raw": "Maybe toilet flies laid eggs in your head"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "8ec92735",
"en_raw": "and hatched?"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "da19a5e5",
"en_raw": "But 'double suicide cases'"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "4985cbb3",
"en_raw": "they say it on the news, right?"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "81813036",
"en_raw": "Sango"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "7d3d18d6",
"en_raw": "What kind of case is that?"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "4ed45a7d",
"en_raw": "...Huh"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "b155a3b7",
"en_raw": "You don't even know that?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "34b6a4e7",
"en_raw": "Kurumi doesn't know either"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "b37cf3ee",
"en_raw": "Hey, what's a double suicide?"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "b59f0838",
"en_raw": "Well, it's, you know..."
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "de9a62b3",
"en_raw": "...Like a forced murder-suicide"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "1c36ab04",
"en_raw": "That doesn't explain anything"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "5ad1671c",
"en_raw": "Well, basically..."
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "77941550",
"en_raw": "...Just like it's written"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "d4d5f0dc",
"en_raw": "'Heart' and 'inside'?"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "84350b75",
"en_raw": "Yes..."
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "4027ad65",
"en_raw": "Someone's heart gets all messed up"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "97dc4e36",
"en_raw": "and the person who goes crazy"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "c208c950",
"en_raw": "kills the people close to them"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "a971d602",
"en_raw": "one after another"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "895130ba",
"en_raw": "...For example, with a flashlight on their head"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "e9b432f0",
"en_raw": "chasing them around"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "aeb489f1",
"en_raw": "And finally the person"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "86e65e75",
"en_raw": "kills themselves, too"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "de10c962",
"en_raw": "It's like, totally"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "4ea63822",
"en_raw": "Aaaaaagh! you know"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "8b58e9d4",
"en_raw": "...Pretty gruesome, huh?"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "fc7f31bb",
"en_raw": "Sango, you're scary..."
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "6b0fd171",
"en_raw": "...I didn't know"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "7660b4aa",
"en_raw": "that the car sunk in the reservoir"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "fa31fea3",
"en_raw": "had such a scary story"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "ec6fb401",
"en_raw": "Actually, I..."
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "6149b291",
"en_raw": "But you know, often"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "984aa90b",
"en_raw": "those incidents that go beyond reason"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "f0d6658d",
"en_raw": "steeped in madness"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "02cc36e2",
"en_raw": "happen in backwaters like this"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "184026ef",
"en_raw": "So be careful, Nao"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "b2dda0ec",
"en_raw": "...Yeah"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "badc6d2c",
"en_raw": "Well then, shall we go?"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "986bb2c1",
"en_raw": "...The forest reservoir!"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "f3a43a92",
"en_raw": "The reservoir"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "0fef00e6",
"en_raw": "is deep inside Tsukazato Forest, right?"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "4381eb61",
"en_raw": "We'd better hurry, it'll get dark"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "db3567f8",
"en_raw": "Sango, you're really going?"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "bd5867f4",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants to see too"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "a8fd4dbb",
"en_raw": "Double suicide"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "c0da01ca",
"en_raw": "It's a story that's"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "724fd592",
"en_raw": "kind of hard to pin down"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "9e2b072b",
"en_raw": "...Who did it, and for what purpose"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "985933be",
"en_raw": "committed mass murder"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "13188384",
"en_raw": "...So a double suicide"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "733ea22f",
"en_raw": "is mass murder?"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "40958a67",
"en_raw": "Of course"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "75c75d3a",
"en_raw": "A huge amount of blood was shed"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "36ba49f5",
"en_raw": "enough to turn that reservoir"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "bfebebd7",
"en_raw": "bright red"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "57947005",
"en_raw": "I don't want to go anymore..."
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "57eddad2",
"en_raw": "Hey, what were you looking at in the water?"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "8ad545a7",
"en_raw": "...Hey, a turtle?"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "dcf26e2c",
"en_raw": "Just dirty water"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "5bf3ed11",
"en_raw": "Really, really?"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "f10e9860",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants to see too"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "5b01174a",
"en_raw": "Yeah, either way"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "88ebf733",
"en_raw": "we have no choice but to go again"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "08a58061",
"en_raw": "Sango, I bet"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "9df13440",
"en_raw": "there are frogs there"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "2ffa2b40",
"en_raw": "...Shiina, you once"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "7a036bde",
"en_raw": "put a little frog"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "f2a1226c",
"en_raw": "in your mouth and spat it out, right?"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "2b765008",
"en_raw": "If you do that again"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "08bd30f5",
"en_raw": "I'll kill you"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "e70f5cfc",
"en_raw": "But Kurumi is going to the pond"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "650b50c9",
"en_raw": "and with Melos"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "4db69cfd",
"en_raw": "she'll watch the double suicide"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "330184be",
"en_raw": "Hey, this cell phone"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "9aafce38",
"en_raw": "works perfectly"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "d9707a87",
"en_raw": "An unexpected find"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "fa231df4",
"en_raw": "I'm making this mine from today"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "321c1a0e",
"en_raw": "No, we have to turn it in to the police"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "291c739f",
"en_raw": "That's you, Mr. Serious..."
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "9bb3068e",
"en_raw": "If the owner notices"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "a4e23da7",
"en_raw": "it'll be found out right away"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "991aa3ac",
"en_raw": "Let's take it to the police"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "552bcba8",
"en_raw": "Kurumi has turned in lots too"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "d3ef6763",
"en_raw": "Tch"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "c873a340",
"en_raw": "What a waste, but oh well"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "c3a0024c",
"en_raw": "While we're at it, about the double suicide"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "7fd4fcbb",
"en_raw": "I'll ask them every detail"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "789e35ca",
"en_raw": "Then Kurumi will"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "c1abf639",
"en_raw": "take it there!"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "01ce9110",
"en_raw": "No, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "b2a88b35",
"en_raw": "you can't explain it"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "c8b73743",
"en_raw": "...By the way, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "09414f33",
"en_raw": "who was the call from?"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "bc14e119",
"en_raw": "Dunno, a woman"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "84542d77",
"en_raw": "She was angry"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "2fcb54ec",
"en_raw": "The cell phone"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "51f0bb14",
"en_raw": "we need to take to the police box"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "861b5ba4",
"en_raw": "The main street by school, or the station"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "7d65ed57",
"en_raw": "...Which way?"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "10d20f67",
"en_raw": "I don't really get it, but"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "b81553da",
"en_raw": "It was just a messy"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "74ce858c",
"en_raw": "story between a man and a woman"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "ca08dd2b",
"en_raw": "...That's totally different, isn't it?"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "1fa65a7a",
"en_raw": "What is?"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "e1f69f1c",
"en_raw": "from what Sango said"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "922fe26f",
"en_raw": "about the double suicide"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "cba98247",
"en_raw": "How so?"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "be4e4e0e",
"en_raw": "I mean, you said"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "b39f0daa",
"en_raw": "hearts getting messed up"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "6f4f0ed2",
"en_raw": "and mass murder"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "8c512252",
"en_raw": "and all that crazy stuff"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "43bafc82",
"en_raw": "It's about right, isn't it?"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "87d79e6f",
"en_raw": "You're always so careless"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "44118463",
"en_raw": "Better than the Toilet Gang"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "80d9dd53",
"en_raw": "...Saying 'let's die together'"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "5d8aef07",
"en_raw": "no one's such a softie"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "2be622ba",
"en_raw": "that they'd actually die"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "a25b4129",
"en_raw": "...True"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "e18069dd",
"en_raw": "Saying 'let's run the marathon together'"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "e38c910d",
"en_raw": "is about as off as that"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "9ba6675f",
"en_raw": "What do you mean?"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "e6fda95c",
"en_raw": "Love, friendship"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "e4a00188",
"en_raw": "it's always the ones who want to confirm it"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "c38bd92b",
"en_raw": "who decide they've been betrayed"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "c47b4acf",
"en_raw": "mess up their own hearts"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "716d7fda",
"en_raw": "and cause gruesome incidents"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "75a8f99b",
"en_raw": "in the world, I'm saying"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "9eddfe57",
"en_raw": "The day the Toilet Gang's false friendship"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "1ebd338f",
"en_raw": "turns into hatred"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "7f2ef929",
"en_raw": "I'm so looking forward"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "8126fe8d",
"en_raw": "to it, I can't help it"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "a0049f4f",
"en_raw": "Huh, a phone ringing..."
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "627a0e3a",
"en_raw": "Stop it, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "d019b990",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Double Suicide!"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "cb41b189",
"en_raw": "Segawa complained to me that"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "0d246ded",
"en_raw": "he can't go to the reservoir anymore"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "517b677c",
"en_raw": "Wimp, worm"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "cd52d56d",
"en_raw": "pinch him and throw him away!"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}